TestRemoteMagpieQuotaIsAskedNotReplayed (c37b8b659) pins the fix with a
402 out of a Coding Plan; the face XIQI reports (#4202) is the 429 half
of the same rest: a remote magpie's group member refused with a 429 that
names a session limit, this magpie rests the remote's model for as long
as the Retry-After passed on says (an hour, longestWait), and gives the
429 again on every request until then — the official quota having come
back long before. Rest.there marks a remote magpie's model rest whatever
the status (remoteModelRest reads failQuota for a 429 that says a plan
is used up), and quotaHeld passes it by, so the test only pins the 429
form: red with the marking lifted (the replay is the reporter's word
for word, "(out of its allowance: not asked again before …)"), green as
it stands.

